contentText:
Britney Spears can&#8217;t stop saying gimme more Beyoncé lately. In a recent Instagram post, the Princess of Pop shared videos of herself dancing to some of Queen Bey&#8217;s music and revealed that she can&#8217;t get enough.

&#8220;So weird how all i listen to is the last @beyonce album,&#8221; Spears began, referencing 2024&#8217;s two-week Billboard 200 -topper Cowboy Carter . &#8220;I absolutely love it but damn not sure why I go back to her earlier naughty album….the dress told me to do it I guess.&#8221;

